# Ending description. Maybe a slideshow. At the end of the credits scenes? Mittens stole bell. Rat king and pigeon royalty dapping each other up. Xiu & macaron being happy together.
After that whole ordeal the truth became known. Mittens was the one who stole the Pigeon Heirloom long ago and blamed it on the rats! After that revelation the Rat King and the King and Queen of PigeonLand came to a truce. Now Xiu and Macaron are able to live their lives freely in the open! You completed your mission of not only saving your OTP of suffering but you also stopped a war! Wow, good job you! What an amazing raccoon!








